<title>KENYA: Eight Israelis on board hijacked plane - sources.</title>
<headline>Eight Israelis on board hijacked plane - sources.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight Israelis were on board a hijacked Ethiopian Airlines Boeing 767, carrying 175 passengers and crew, which crashed into the sea near the Comoro Islands on Saturday, aviation sources in Nairobi told Reuters.</p>
<p>They said they had no other details. At least 50 people were killed in the accident which 45 other survived. A further 50 bodies have so far been fished out of the sea.</p>
</text>
